UPDATE companies SET description='Precision Cable Assemblies Inc. (PCA) was founded in 1980 in Brookfield, Wisconsin, a suburb of Milwaukee. The company began as a wire harness manufacturer and has since expanded into a global supplier of power distribution solutions.

PCA manufactures wire harnesses ranging from single-circuit assemblies to complex designs with over 300 circuits, battery cables and interconnects, and custom overmolded cable assemblies. Its capabilities include design and development, rapid prototyping, program management with PPAP support, CAD modeling, and in-house injection molding for over-molding and connector production. The company operates manufacturing facilities in Brookfield, Wisconsin; Qingdao, China; and Monterrey, Mexico, with a warehousing and distribution center in Waukesha, Wisconsin, all linked by a single SAP ERP system.

The company serves original equipment manufacturers across construction equipment, agricultural machinery, power generation, lawn and garden, marine, recreational and utility vehicles, trailer chassis, over-the-road trucks, emergency vehicles, and small-engine applications. Notable projects include heavy-duty harnesses for semi-trailers, marine battery cables, UTV engine compartment solutions, and a large off-highway program for Husco.

PCA emphasizes a lean, vertically integrated model with continuous process improvement (5S, Kaizen, DMAIC) and round-the-clock engineering collaboration across its three plants. It offers vendor-managed inventory, Kanban, and EDI logistics programs, and aims to deliver on-time, quality products with accurate communication.', certifications=ARRAY['ISO 9001:2015','IATF 16949:2016']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom wire harness manufacturing", "Battery cable assembly", "Custom cable overmolding", "Connector overmolding", "Design and development", "Rapid prototyping", "Program management (PPAP)", "CAD modeling (2D/3D)", "Logistics management", "Inventory management (VMI, Kanban, EDI)", "Injection molding", "Over-molding", "Boot production", "Terminal connector production", "Single wire production", "Continuous process improvement (5S, Kaizen, DMAIC)", "PPAP support", "Round-the-clock engineering collaboration"], "industries": ["Construction equipment", "Agricultural equipment", "Power generation", "Lawn and garden", "Marine", "Recreational vehicles", "Utility vehicles", "Trailer chassis", "Over-the-road vehicles", "Emergency vehicles", "Small engines", "Golf carts", "Consumer appliances", "Professional appliances", "Powersport vehicles", "Boat and watercraft", "Off-highway equipment"], "materials": [], "equipment": ["Injection molding machines", "SAP ERP system", "BEAS/Oracle ERP system"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["In-house injection molding and over-molding capabilities", "Global manufacturing footprint with facilities in the US, China, and Mexico", "Single SAP ERP system across all locations for uniform standards", "Vendor-managed inventory, Kanban, and EDI supply chain programs", "Prototype and low-volume production in condensed time frames"], "facts_used": ["Founded 1980 -> db, /about", "Headquarters Brookfield, Wisconsin -> db, /about", "Certifications ISO 9001:2015 and IATF 16949:2016 -> db, /quality", "Wire harness 