UPDATE companies SET description='Precision Molding & Machining operates from Sparks, Nevada, just outside Reno. The business traces its roots to 1998 when it was founded as American Class A Molds, a dedicated mold-making operation. Over the following decades the company expanded into full-service custom injection molding and precision machining.

The shop combines plastic injection molding with a complete machine shop under one roof. Press capacity spans 75 to 350 tons, with additional presses on order. Machining capabilities include four vertical CNC mills equipped with fourth-axis rotary tables, two EDM units, surface grinders, and manual lathes and mills. This equipment mix allows the team to produce molded components, build and maintain tooling, and finish parts to tight specifications in a single facility.

Customers come from military, medical device, material handling, automotive, and specialty electronics sectors. The company emphasizes long-term partnerships that take projects from concept through finished production, supplying both molded and machined components to OEMs and contract manufacturers across the western U.S.', certifications=ARRAY['ISO 9001:2015']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Plastic injection molding", "CNC vertical milling (4-axis)", "EDM", "Surface grinding", "Manual turning", "Manual milling", "Mold/tool building", "Contract manufacturing"], "industries": ["Military", "Medical Device", "Material Handling", "Automotive", "Specialty Electronics"], "materials": [], "equipment": ["Injection molding presses (75-350 ton)", "Four vertical CNC mills with 4th axis", "Surface grinders", "2 EDM machines", "Manual lathe", "Manual mills"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Press capacity from 75 to 350 tons with additional machines on order", "Four vertical CNC mills with fourth-axis capability", "In-house EDM, surface grinding, and manual machining", "ISO 9001:2015 certified quality system", "Concept-to-production partnerships with in-house tooling support"], "facts_used": ["Founded 1998 as American Class A Molds -> db, /", "Acquired by Precision Molding & Machining in 2020 -> db, /", "Headquarters in Sparks, Nevada -> db, /", "ISO 9001:2015 certified -> db, /", "Serves military, medical device, material handling, automotive, specialty electronics -> db, /", "Press capacity 75 to 350 tons -> /", "Four vertical CNC mills with 4th axis capabilities -> /", "Surface grinders, 2 EDM, manual lathe and mills -> /", "Custom injection molder, contract manufacturer, precision machine shop -> /", "Serves clients throughout Western United States -> /", "Long-term partnerships from concept to finished product -> /", "Goal to be premier custom molder and machine shop in region -> /"], "company_type": null, "makes_products": null, "type_e