UPDATE companies SET description='Prime Molding Technologies, Inc. was founded in 2002 in Riviera Beach, Florida, by a management team with more than 50 years of combined injection molding experience. The South Florida operation began with a customer-oriented and quality-oriented approach that has driven its growth.

The company runs a 24-hour, climate-controlled facility registered to ISO 9001:2015, housing 22 Nissei high-precision injection molding machines ranging from 20 to 500 tons. These machines, all equipped with robots and supported by auxiliary equipment such as central water recirculation, mold temperature controllers, and desiccant dryers, produce precision parts weighing from a few grams to over 2.5 pounds. Beyond molding, Prime Molding offers mold design and manufacturing, high-volume automated assembly, sonic welding, flow-wrapper packaging, part decoration, and fulfillment services. An on-site machine shop handles mold maintenance and repair, while tooling is sourced both domestically and offshore.

Customers span marine, automotive, electrical, medical, and pharmaceutical sectors. The company also accepts transferred-in problem tooling and provides just-in-time domestic delivery.

Prime Molding attributes its competitiveness to a lean corporate structure and state-of-the-art automation, which it says allows domestic pricing to rival offshore options while maintaining shorter lead times and shipping convenience. The stated goal is to meet or exceed customer expectations through quality, service, and low prices.', certifications=ARRAY['ISO 9001:2015']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Injection molding of engineering and commodity grade thermoplastics", "Mold design and mold manufacturing", "Medical molding", "Automotive molding", "Precision parts molding (few grams to 2.5 lbs)", "High-volume high-speed automated assembly", "Working with transferred-in problem tooling", "Just-in-Time domestic delivery", "Assembly", "Sonic welding", "Flow wrapper packaging", "Part decoration", "Order packaging and fulfillment", "Design services (CAD files, rapid prototypes)", "In-house machine shop for mold service and maintenance", "Tooling production (offshore and domestic)"], "industries": ["Marine", "Automotive", "Electrical", "Medical", "Pharmaceutical"], "materials": ["Engineering and commodity grade thermoplastics"], "equipment": ["22 Nissei high precision injection molding machines (20 to 500 tons)", "Robots on all machines", "Central water recirculation system", "Mold temperature controllers", "Chillers", "Desiccant dryers", "Hot drop controllers", "Core pull", "Air assist", "Sonic welding equipment", "Pad printing equipment", "Process monitoring systems", "Automatic shut down and alarming systems"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["24-hour operation in climate-controlled ISO 9001:2015 facility", "22 Nissei high-precision injection molding machines (20\u2013500 tons)", "In-house machine shop for mold service and maintenance", "Lean manufacturing practices enabling domestic pricing competitive with offshore", "Just-in-Time domestic delivery"], "facts_used": ["Founded in 2002 by management team with 50+ years experience ->