UPDATE companies SET description='Quality Snack Foods Inc. began in 1986 in Chicago''s historic stockyards district, founded to produce pork rinds and crackling pellets. The operation relocated in 1990 to the city''s Back of the Yards neighborhood, expanding its "pop and pack" capabilities. In 2008 the company moved into a 105,000-square-foot, USDA-inspected facility in Alsip, Illinois, where it remains headquartered.

The Alsip plant houses state-of-the-art cookers, fryers, and packaging lines that turn out pork rinds, cracklings, chicken-skin snacks, chicharrones, fried harina (wheat-flour snacks), and pre-cooked bacon for food-service channels. The vertically integrated operation controls every step from raw-material sourcing through seasoning, frying, and final packaging, allowing flexible run sizes and custom seasoning blends.

Primary customers are private-label brands, food-service distributors, and wholesale buyers across the United States.

Quality Snack Foods emphasizes its SQF certification, on-site USDA inspection, and the "Quality" name as a commitment to consistent product safety and cleanliness. The founders'' collective 90-plus years in meat and snack processing underpin the company''s focus on vertical integration as a means to maintain strict quality control from source to shelf.', certifications=ARRAY['SQF (Safe Quality Food)']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Pork rind manufacturing", "Pork crackling production", "Chicken skin snack production", "Chicharr\u00f3n manufacturing", "Fried harina (wheat flour snack) production", "Pre-cooked bacon manufacturing", "Custom bacon cooking", "Private label packaging", "Seasoning application", "Flexible packaging configurations", "Vertical integration (sourcing, production, packaging)", "USDA inspected processing", "SQF certified food safety management"], "industries": ["Food service", "Private label manufacturing", "Snack food distribution", "Wholesale food distribution"], "materials": ["Pork", "Wheat flour (harina)", "Chicken skin", "Pork belly (bacon)", "Seasonings"], "equipment": ["Cookers", "Fryers", "Packaging equipment"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Vertically integrated from sourcing through packaging", "On-site USDA inspection and SQF certification", "State-of-the-art cookers, fryers, and packaging equipment", "Private-label specialty with extensive seasoning portfolio", "Custom bacon cooking for food-service applications"], "facts_used": ["Founded 1986 in Chicago stockyards -> /", "Relocated 1990 to Back of the Yards neighborhood -> /", "Moved 2008 to 105,000 sq ft facility in Alsip, IL -> /", "Manufactures pork rinds, cracklings, chicken skin snacks, chicharrones, fried harina, pre-cooked bacon -> /", "Vertically integrated sourcing to packaging -> /", "SQF certified -> /", "USDA inspected on-site -> /", "Serves private label, food service, distributors nationwide -> /", "Custom bacon for pizza, salads, 