UPDATE companies SET description='Redstar Worldwide was founded in 2007 and is headquartered in Salt Lake City, Utah. The company operates as a single-source printed circuit board (PCB) solutions provider, coordinating with both domestic and international manufacturing partners to deliver boards from prototype through production.

The firm offers a range of PCB fabrication services including quick-turn prototyping, high-density interconnect (HDI) technology, rigid-flex and flexible circuits, metal-core boards, and high-temperature materials. Capabilities span single- and double-sided boards up to 36-layer multilayer constructions. Engineering support covers design for manufacturability, specialized coatings, through-hole plating, and coverlay application.

Redstar serves customers in green energy and solar, medical equipment, telecommunications, and automotive sectors. Its client base includes a global audio and infotainment company, an electronics manufacturing services (EMS) provider, and other global OEMs that have relied on the company since its founding year.

The company emphasizes 24/7 communication across domestic and offshore teams, a commitment to matching price and quality, and a hassle-free process from design to destination. These differentiators were highlighted in customer testimonials citing responsiveness, technical support, and on-time delivery.', certifications=ARRAY['ISO 9001','ISO 13485','NADCAP','ITAR']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["PCB fabrication (1-36 layers)", "Quick-turn prototyping", "HDI (High Density Interconnect) fabrication", "Rigid-flex PCB fabrication", "Flex PCB fabrication", "Metal core PCB fabrication", "High-temperature PCB fabrication", "Engineering design support", "Design for manufacturability (DFM)", "Specialized PCB coatings", "Through-hole plating", "Coverlay application", "Domestic and international manufacturing coordination"], "industries": ["Green Energy", "Solar Energy", "Medical", "Telecommunications", "Automotive"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["24/7 domestic and offshore communication", "Single-source PCB management from design to delivery", "Network of domestic and international manufacturing partners", "Quick-turn prototyping and HDI capability", "Engineering support including DFM and specialized coatings"], "facts_used": ["Founded in 2007 -> db", "Headquarters in Salt Lake City, Utah -> db", "Certifications: ISO9001, ISO13485, NADCAP, ITAR -> db", "Single-source PCB solution with quick turn prototyping, HDI, rigid-flex, flex, metal core, engineering services -> page ''/''", "Fabrication from single/double-sided to 36-layer multilayer boards -> page ''/''", "Domestic and international supplier network -> page ''/''", "24/7 communications domestic & offshore -> page ''/''", "Industries served: green energy, solar, medical, telecommunications, automotive -> page ''/'' and industries_served", "Customer testimonials from global audio & infotainment company, EMS company, global company -> page ''/''", "Eng